# {{ project_title }}

A modular {{ problem_type }} example with synthetic data, local MLflow tracking, and
Databricks Declarative Automation Bundles. Read `docs/operations.md` before deploying.

```bash
uv sync --group dev --group docs
make test lint security docs-build
make demo
make docs  # PORT=8001 to override
```

The demo writes predictions, metrics and two monitoring dashboards under
`artifacts/demo/`. One report has no outcomes; the second demonstrates a delayed
label join on the untouched synthetic test set. No Databricks credentials are needed.
Commit `uv.lock` after `uv lock` and use `uv sync --locked` in CI.

`template-basis.yml` records the reviewed skill versions/hashes, tested Databricks CLI
and validation scope of the template. `.copier-answers.yml` identifies the template
source and Git revision when available. See `docs/operations.md` for their update policy.
